flowchart LR
    Dev([Developer]) -->|git push origin main| GHA(GitHub Actions)

    subgraph "CI: Testing & Linting"
        GHA --> GoTest[Go Unit Tests]
        GHA --> GoLint[Staticcheck / gofmt]
        GHA --> FlutterLint[ESLint / Prettier]
    end

    GoTest -->|Pass| CD
    GoLint -->|Pass| CD
    FlutterLint -->|Pass| CD

    subgraph "CD: Deployment"
        CD{Split CD} -->|Backend Changed| SSH[ssh-action]
        CD -->|Mobile Changed| EAS[Flutter EAS Build]
    end

    SSH -->|Trigger| VPS[(Production VPS)]
    VPS --> Pull[git pull]
    Pull --> DockerBuild[docker compose build]
    DockerBuild --> DockerUp[docker swap]

    EAS -->|Cloud macOS| CompileIOS[Compile .ipa]
    EAS -->|Cloud Linux| CompileAnd[Compile .aab]
    CompileIOS --> TestFlight{Apple TestFlight}
    CompileAnd --> PlayStore{Google Play Console}
